  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "i",
      "label": "(I)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have you heard of the last city on top of the sacred mountain,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where the immortal god shoulders the eternal sun?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In silence, dawn lingers on."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In stillness, hope is never truly gone"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d865be86b3509e15"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O displaced soul, where does your path now lead?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The black tide's surging. Chaos is raging. Death is prevailing."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O exiled vagabond, do you still expect tomorrow?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The gods are silent. Fate is gloomy. Madness is rampaging"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3be021f97505e38d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Seek the paradise amidst the fallen world,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where sunlight, pure springs, and fertile soil still exist."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Find the veranda of that merciful god,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where , feasts, and fine wine are not yet lost"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5d3052721ea52b85"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe-2"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "ii",
      "label": "(II)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The deserted capital of Three Titans, now overrun by the black tide and its evil creatures."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The shattered tiles, once witnesses of gods' miracles, now shrouded in the haze of an eternal night."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I heard that this used to be the holy land of the faithful and a refuge for the lost."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But I see that the palaces are now homes for snakes and rats, playgrounds for worms and bugs"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f183419ba2b60659"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As the gods fell silent, the priests abandoned them, and all mortals lost their homeland."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "All were displaced, as the Holy Maiden rebelled and fled, becoming with the passages scattered fleeting starlight."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Behind the gates, bitter winds whisper divine decrees. Before the balanced scales, wild weeds thrive unchallenged."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The burdens of the abyss are too heavy to endure. The prophetic words are too promising to fulfill."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-550a6c5a748ad9f7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Looking around, a heavy melancholy swells"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Humans without gods are like a boat adrift without its oars."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where can the body find shelter, now that the Era Chrysea has passed?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What can comfort the soul, when the world is filled with dread?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c9e85611f40ff118"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe-2"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "iii",
      "label": "(III)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": []
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A mobile citadel, a city that rose amidst chaos."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fearless and fierce, it never attempts to conceal its prowess."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Drifting high in the sky, it appears to be close to Aquila."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet, its loyalty belongs solely to Nikador's spear."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-66fcf45298a2410d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Every Kremnoan troop is elite. Every Kremnoan weapon is refined."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Every Kremnoan is a glorious warrior who will never betray the name of soldiers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They drink pomegranate juice as if it were blood. They keep their blades close at hand."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Their final paths always lead them to battlefields vast."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3e1022b0e16264c9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Listen —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sons of Gorgo are singing that tune once more:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Valorous death before glorious return!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Be crowned in blood, and death is our supreme honor!\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e1ad49e59af8529a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe-2"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
